{"availability":"available","full":"ahmedkhan1/ngx-ai-devtools","name":"ngx-ai-devtools","description":"Floating DevTools panel that intercepts OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Mistral, Groq, and Cohere calls in your Angular app and shows you the prompt, response, tokens, cost, and tool use.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":225,"forks":153,"created":"2026-06-15T14:13:49Z","updated":"2026-06-19T15:07:42Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ngx-ai-devtools.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://ngx-ai-devtools.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:46:13.565Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:46:13.565Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:46:13.565Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T09:08:16.535Z","stars":225,"forks":153},{"at":"2026-10-16T02:46:13.565Z","stars":225,"forks":153}],"technologies":["Angular"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Network-tab-style DevTools for LLM calls in Angular apps. See every prompt, response, token, and dollar your app spends — without leaving the browser.","A floating DevTools panel that intercepts every LLM call your Angular app makes — fetch, HttpClient, OpenAI SDK, Anthropic SDK, anything. Shows the prompt, response, tokens, cost, tool calls, and streaming deltas in real time. One provider call to install. Works in dev, staging, and production behind a feature flag.","Debugging LLM calls in the browser is genuinely painful. You make a call, something goes wrong, and now you're three tabs deep: Network panel for the request, a JSON viewer for the body, a calculator for the cost. Ten minutes later you tweak the prompt and do it all over again."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ahmedkhan1/ngx-ai-devtools/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"760a958c6d840132f6affa489238e0b2f7bb2a101299be80c00cadda9b851f72","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:16.685Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:16.685Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItD